# S2: an all-four reset with the heal, then the first four-card attach of the S2 engine on the gate-only profile, with a short
# smoke (a warmup, one coding stream, four concurrent streams: the first packed-4 rounds). The cheapest quad step that runs every
# four-card piece the card harnesses cannot: the fast path's own collectives (the four-way FP32 gather-add, the drafter gathers
# at Linear), the shard-argmax verify with its T1 audit against the pinned sampler (on in this profile), the T2 windows audit,
# the proposal audit, and the K64j extent program at one KV head inside the served model.
# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the four-card S2 window (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it):
# copy it over .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/s2 and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Nothing here
# names a rig, a card or a registry: the cards are resolved at run time. A placeholder in @...@ is filled in by whoever drives
# the window (the graft directory and the graft binary digest of the one-card harnesses); every other value is final.
# ONE IMAGE FOR THE WHOLE WINDOW: C2_IMAGE_TAG names the image S0 builds from this same commit; a later commit needs a new tag.
# Duration (estimate): reset 1-3 min (heal up to 3 more); the first engine build is the long part, 10-30 min (kernel compile on a
# cold cache, the fast path's weight staging on the existing four-card cache); the three tests 5-12 min: 20-50 min in all (step
# limit 210 min). A hang in the first collective shows as a silent container until the smoke's ready loop ends (80 min).
# Read: the ready line; the launched-argv line (profile c2-packed-tp4-gate, QWEN_FAST_TP=4); the mesh and ring lines; EVERY packed-any
# admission UNQUALIFIED line (the waiver logs each unqualified piece: expected are only the pending evidence sections and the
# not-yet-hosted qualifications; anything else is an admission fault); the verify t1 engaged and verify t1 audit lines with NO
# audit mismatch; coherent text in coding and concurrent4.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset smoke
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-s2-1
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-gate
C2_SMOKE_TESTS=warmup,coding,concurrent4
